-> Start/ Stop
poweron -c 
poweroff / powercycle / reset


-> Control variables
setsc var value 
< e.g., setsc netsc_dhcp true >
showsc netsc_dhcp


-> View OS terminal
console     // to view OS console hit #. to return back>
console -f  // to take force write control (useful when there are multiple sessions)


-> Debugging and Breaking in:
break (to enter OK or OS kdb prompt if booted with kdb)


-> Password
by default dhcp is on and passwd is on the back of the chassis (use last 8 digits
from serial#>
